## Keeping Rules Updated

When the project changes, update these rules accordingly:

| Change | Update |
|--------|--------|
| New important library | Add to Tech Stack table |
| New folder in `src/` | Add to Project Structure; update path aliases if new |
| New path alias | Add to Path Aliases; update `components.json` reference |
| New util function | Add to `utils/<domain>.ts` (e.g. `utils/file.ts` for file helpers) |
| New route group or flow | Add to Route Architecture |
| New domain concept | Add to `matchvaga-domain.mdc` |
| New design file or workflow | Update `pencil-design-to-code.mdc` |
| New design components or tokens | Update `design-system.mdc` and `globals.css` |
| App Router patterns, loading/error | See `nextjs-app-router.mdc` |
| React purity, hooks, Thinking in React | See `react-rules.mdc` |
